@startuml
!include ../themes/proveo.puml
skinparam noteTextAlignment left
' SPEC: _spec/_plans/game-export-localstorage.puml
' purpose: starchess_match_history can be downloaded as a file the player keeps
' status: proposed 2026-09-17, not implemented; product = StarChess
' covers: apps/starchess/src/store/matchHistoryStore.ts
'         apps/starchess/src/store/matchSessionStore.ts
'         packages/starchess-core/src/replay/record.ts
'         apps/starchess/src/screens/ReviewScreen.tsx
' live spec: _spec/apps/starchess/replay-import.puml
'   outcome this file must copy ........ _spec/_plans/forfeit-as-loss.puml
'   turn cap this dump may include ..... _spec/_plans/turn-45-draw-stop.puml
' Notes are capped at 5 lines x 50 columns; one idea per anchor.
'
' ── WHAT THE LINE ITEM SETTLES ─────────────────────────────────────────────
' File export is a COPY of the live localStorage record. Import already
' exists (ReviewScreen file input → ""addArenaRecord"" /
' ""historyFromRecord""). Export is the missing half of that round-trip.
'
' ── WHAT IT DOES NOT SETTLE ────────────────────────────────────────────────
'   a second schema beside ArenaGameRecord / StarChessGameRecord
'   Coach chess_coach_game_history / gameShare.ts (different product)
'   whether a mid-match session blob is in the first slice
title PLANNED — export is a file copy of history;\nimport already exists

database "starchess_match_history" as HIST <<db>>
component "ReviewScreen\nfile import (shipped)" as IMP <<app>>
component "export download\n(missing)" as EX <<app>>
component "historyFromRecord\nvalidateArenaRecord" as CORE <<app>>
component "**rebuild by replaying**\ndisagrees after a rules patch" as LIE <<error>>

HIST ARROW_MAIN IMP : already
HIST ARROW_OPTIONAL EX : this plan
EX ARROW_MAIN CORE : same envelope
IMP ARROW_MAIN CORE
EX ARROW_ERROR LIE : if it reconstructs

note bottom of IMP
  **Import is not the gap.**
  ""replay-import.puml"" already files
  arena JSON into
  ""starchess_match_history"".
end note

note bottom of EX
  **Version the envelope and copy
  ""result"", ""opponent"", ""scfens"",
  ""resolves"".** A dump that omits
  outcome fights forfeit-as-loss.
end note

note right of LIE
  **Copy the stored record rather
  than re-running ""endScTurn"".**
  Reconstruction drifts the moment
  resolve changes.
end note

legend bottom
  **The order to do it in**
  ==
  **1. Document the live blob.**
  ""MATCH_HISTORY_KEY"", ""StarChessGameRecord"",
  core ""ArenaGameRecord"". No new type.
  --
  **2. Ship download.** Same JSON the importer
  already accepts, plus schema version.
  Outcome is the engine/app enum (leave is
  a loss once that plan lands).
  ==
  **3. Keep import as the reader.** Round-trip
  one real file as a bug attachment before
  adding zip-of-slots or PII stripping.
  --
  **Left open**: filename; live session dump;
  whether Coach share-by-link is ever related.
end legend
@enduml
